{"id":"ru-01e31447e9eb.ru","jokeId":"ru-01e31447e9eb","locale":"ru","adaptation":"original","notes":"Source wording kept; the girl's long line split before the request so the punch lands on its own. Phone call as a split screen: the radio host with a headset in the studio on top, the girl on her sofa with a phone below. The TV studio stands in for the radio studio.","title":"Песня по заявке","location":"ofis","cast":["nachalnik","devushka"],"roles":{"nachalnik":"tv-host","devushka":"woman"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Звонит герла на радио и говорит:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"devushka","text":"Вчера нашла кошелёк, там было пять тысяч долларов, шестьсот восемнадцать марок и визитка на имя Гарика Марикяна, проспект Шверника, девятнадцать...","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"devushka","text":"Поставьте ему, пожалуйста, какую-нибудь хорошую песню!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"ofis","place":"tv-studio","cast":["nachalnik","devushka"],"roles":{"nachalnik":"tv-host","devushka":"woman"},"looks":{"nachalnik":{"add":["headset"],"remove":[]}},"split":{"location":"gostinaya","cast":["devushka"]},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"nachalnik","to":"host"},{"type":"move","who":"devushka","to":"sofa"},{"type":"prop","who":"devushka","item":"phone","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"act","who":"nachalnik","act":"nod"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"act","who":"nachalnik","act":"scratch-head"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"}]}]}
{"id":"ru-01e31447e9eb.en","jokeId":"ru-01e31447e9eb","locale":"en","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Translated line by line; per adaptNote the Armenian name and Moscow address became Gary Mitchell, 19 Sheridan Avenue, and the long-gone German marks became euros next to the dollars. 'Герла' (hippie slang) → 'chick'. Split screen phone call: radio host in the studio on top, the girl on her sofa below.","title":"Song Request","location":"ofis","cast":["nachalnik","devushka"],"roles":{"nachalnik":"tv-host","devushka":"woman"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"A chick calls a radio station and says:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"devushka","text":"Yesterday I found a wallet, there were five thousand dollars in it, six hundred and eighteen euros and a business card in the name of Gary Mitchell, nineteen Sheridan Avenue...","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"devushka","text":"Could you please play him some nice song!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"ofis","place":"tv-studio","cast":["nachalnik","devushka"],"roles":{"nachalnik":"tv-host","devushka":"woman"},"looks":{"nachalnik":{"add":["headset"],"remove":[]}},"split":{"location":"gostinaya","cast":["devushka"]},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"nachalnik","to":"host"},{"type":"move","who":"devushka","to":"sofa"},{"type":"prop","who":"devushka","item":"phone","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"act","who":"nachalnik","act":"nod"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"act","who":"nachalnik","act":"scratch-head"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"}]}]}
{"id":"ru-01e31447e9eb.de","jokeId":"ru-01e31447e9eb","locale":"de","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Translated line by line; per adaptNote the name and address became Gerd Maier, Schillerstraße neunzehn, currencies swapped to dollars and euros (marks are gone). 'Герла' → 'ein Mädel'. Split screen phone call: radio host on top, the girl on her sofa below.","title":"Musikwunsch","location":"ofis","cast":["nachalnik","devushka"],"roles":{"nachalnik":"tv-host","devushka":"woman"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Ruft ein Mädel beim Radio an und sagt:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"devushka","text":"Gestern habe ich ein Portemonnaie gefunden, da waren fünftausend Dollar drin, sechshundertachtzehn Euro und eine Visitenkarte auf den Namen Gerd Maier, Schillerstraße neunzehn...","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"devushka","text":"Spielen Sie ihm doch bitte irgendein schönes Lied!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"ofis","place":"tv-studio","cast":["nachalnik","devushka"],"roles":{"nachalnik":"tv-host","devushka":"woman"},"looks":{"nachalnik":{"add":["headset"],"remove":[]}},"split":{"location":"gostinaya","cast":["devushka"]},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"nachalnik","to":"host"},{"type":"move","who":"devushka","to":"sofa"},{"type":"prop","who":"devushka","item":"phone","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"act","who":"nachalnik","act":"nod"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"act","who":"nachalnik","act":"scratch-head"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"}]}]}
{"id":"ru-e83b816c03db.ru","jokeId":"ru-e83b816c03db","locale":"ru","adaptation":"original","notes":"Every narrator word kept (typo следущий fixed, numbers as words), split where the action changes so each walk and each dollar lands on its words. Three bar scenes with wipes for the time skips: day one, the next day, the day of revenge. Barman behind the counter at the back, the man in front of him; the counter ends are the left/right marks on the back plane.","title":"Сдача","location":"bar","cast":["barmen","muzhik"],"roles":{"barmen":"bartender","muzhik":"customer"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Мужик заходит в бар, заказывает виски:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Сколько с меня?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"barmen","text":"Три доллара.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Мужик вынимает из кармана три доллара.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Один кладёт на стойку перед собой,","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"потом идёт в левый конец стойки, там кладёт второй,","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"потом идёт в правый конец стойки, там кладёт третий.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Бармен, тихо матерясь, идёт направо-налево и забирает деньги.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"На следующий день опять тот же мужик приходит,","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"опять стаканчик виски заказывает и снова раскладывает доллары в разные концы стойки.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Бармен злится, но за деньгами ходит.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Короче, такая картина повторяется день за днём.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"И вот однажды мужик заказывает виски, берёт стакан,","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"роется в кармане и вытаскивает бумажку в пять долларов.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Бармен быстро эту бумажку берёт, мстительно улыбается,","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"достаёт два доллара сдачи,","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"идёт в левый конец стойки, там кладёт один доллар,","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"потом идёт в правый конец и там кладёт второй.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Затем возвращается и злорадно смотрит на мужика.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Мужик флегматично выпивает виски,","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"вытаскивает из кармана доллар, кладёт его перед собой и говорит:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Пожалуй, возьму ещё стаканчик.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"bar","cast":["barmen","muzhik"],"roles":{"barmen":"bartender","muzhik":"customer"},"looks":{"muzhik":{"add":["flat-cap"],"remove":[]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"barmen","to":"counter"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","from":"off-left","to":"center"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"money","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"money","action":"put"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"left","plane":"back"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"money","action":"hold"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"money","action":"put"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"right","plane":"back"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"money","action":"hold"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"money","action":"put"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"center"},{"type":"move","who":"barmen","to":"right","plane":"back"},{"type":"prop","who":"barmen","item":"money","action":"hold"},{"type":"move","who":"barmen","to":"left","plane":"back"},{"type":"move","who":"barmen","to":"counter"},{"type":"line","ref":"l8"}]},{"location":"bar","transition":"wipe","cast":["barmen","muzhik"],"roles":{"barmen":"bartender","muzhik":"customer"},"looks":{"muzhik":{"add":["flat-cap"],"remove":[]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"barmen","to":"counter"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","from":"off-left","to":"center"},{"type":"line","ref":"l9"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"money","action":"hold"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"left","plane":"back"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"money","action":"put"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"right","plane":"back"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"money","action":"hold"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"money","action":"put"},{"type":"line","ref":"l10"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"center"},{"type":"act","who":"barmen","act":"shake-head"},{"type":"move","who":"barmen","to":"left","plane":"back"},{"type":"prop","who":"barmen","item":"money","action":"hold"},{"type":"move","who":"barmen","to":"right","plane":"back"},{"type":"move","who":"barmen","to":"counter"},{"type":"line","ref":"l11"},{"type":"act","who":"barmen","act":"facepalm"},{"type":"line","ref":"l12"}]},{"location":"bar","transition":"wipe","cast":["barmen","muzhik"],"roles":{"barmen":"bartender","muzhik":"customer"},"looks":{"muzhik":{"add":["flat-cap"],"remove":[]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"barmen","to":"counter"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","from":"off-left","to":"center"},{"type":"prop","who":"barmen","item":"glass","action":"hold"},{"type":"prop","who":"barmen","item":"glass","action":"give","to":"muzhik"},{"type":"line","ref":"l13"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"money","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l14"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"money","action":"give","to":"barmen"},{"type":"line","ref":"l15"},{"type":"prop","who":"barmen","item":"coin","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l16"},{"type":"move","who":"barmen","to":"left","plane":"back"},{"type":"prop","who":"barmen","item":"coin","action":"put"},{"type":"line","ref":"l17"},{"type":"move","who":"barmen","to":"right","plane":"back"},{"type":"prop","who":"barmen","item":"coin","action":"hold"},{"type":"prop","who":"barmen","item":"coin","action":"put"},{"type":"line","ref":"l18"},{"type":"move","who":"barmen","to":"counter"},{"type":"act","who":"barmen","act":"laugh"},{"type":"line","ref":"l19"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"glass","action":"hold"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"drink"},{"type":"line","ref":"l20"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"coin","action":"hold"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"coin","action":"put"},{"type":"line","ref":"l21"},{"type":"line","ref":"l22"}]}]}
{"id":"ru-e83b816c03db.en","jokeId":"ru-e83b816c03db","locale":"en","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Translated line by line, every narration step kept; dollars stay (US bar). Same staging as the original: three bar scenes with wipes, barman behind the counter, counter ends on the back plane left and right.","title":"The Change","location":"bar","cast":["barmen","muzhik"],"roles":{"barmen":"bartender","muzhik":"customer"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"A man walks into a bar and orders a whisky:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"muzhik","text":"How much do I owe you?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"barmen","text":"Three dollars.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"The man takes three dollars out of his pocket.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"He puts one on the bar in front of him,","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"then walks to the left end of the bar and puts the second one there,","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"then walks to the right end of the bar and puts the third one there.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"The bartender, quietly cursing, walks right and left and collects the money.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"The next day the same man comes in again,","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"again orders a glass of whisky and again spreads the dollars out to different ends of the bar.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"The bartender is furious, but he goes for the money.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Long story short, this goes on day after day.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"And then one day the man orders a whisky, takes the glass,","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"digs in his pocket and pulls out a five-dollar bill.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"The bartender quickly grabs the bill, smiles vengefully,","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"takes out two dollars in change,","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"walks to the left end of the bar and puts one dollar there,","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"then walks to the right end and puts the second one there.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Then he comes back and stares at the man, gloating.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"The man calmly drinks his whisky,","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"takes a dollar out of his pocket, puts it down in front of him and says:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"muzhik","text":"I think I'll have another glass.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"bar","cast":["barmen","muzhik"],"roles":{"barmen":"bartender","muzhik":"customer"},"looks":{"muzhik":{"add":["flat-cap"],"remove":[]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"barmen","to":"counter"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","from":"off-left","to":"center"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"money","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"money","action":"put"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"left","plane":"back"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"money","action":"hold"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"money","action":"put"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"right","plane":"back"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"money","action":"hold"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"money","action":"put"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"center"},{"type":"move","who":"barmen","to":"right","plane":"back"},{"type":"prop","who":"barmen","item":"money","action":"hold"},{"type":"move","who":"barmen","to":"left","plane":"back"},{"type":"move","who":"barmen","to":"counter"},{"type":"line","ref":"l8"}]},{"location":"bar","transition":"wipe","cast":["barmen","muzhik"],"roles":{"barmen":"bartender","muzhik":"customer"},"looks":{"muzhik":{"add":["flat-cap"],"remove":[]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"barmen","to":"counter"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","from":"off-left","to":"center"},{"type":"line","ref":"l9"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"money","action":"hold"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"left","plane":"back"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"money","action":"put"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"right","plane":"back"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"money","action":"hold"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"money","action":"put"},{"type":"line","ref":"l10"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"center"},{"type":"act","who":"barmen","act":"shake-head"},{"type":"move","who":"barmen","to":"left","plane":"back"},{"type":"prop","who":"barmen","item":"money","action":"hold"},{"type":"move","who":"barmen","to":"right","plane":"back"},{"type":"move","who":"barmen","to":"counter"},{"type":"line","ref":"l11"},{"type":"act","who":"barmen","act":"facepalm"},{"type":"line","ref":"l12"}]},{"location":"bar","transition":"wipe","cast":["barmen","muzhik"],"roles":{"barmen":"bartender","muzhik":"customer"},"looks":{"muzhik":{"add":["flat-cap"],"remove":[]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"barmen","to":"counter"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","from":"off-left","to":"center"},{"type":"prop","who":"barmen","item":"glass","action":"hold"},{"type":"prop","who":"barmen","item":"glass","action":"give","to":"muzhik"},{"type":"line","ref":"l13"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"money","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l14"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"money","action":"give","to":"barmen"},{"type":"line","ref":"l15"},{"type":"prop","who":"barmen","item":"coin","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l16"},{"type":"move","who":"barmen","to":"left","plane":"back"},{"type":"prop","who":"barmen","item":"coin","action":"put"},{"type":"line","ref":"l17"},{"type":"move","who":"barmen","to":"right","plane":"back"},{"type":"prop","who":"barmen","item":"coin","action":"hold"},{"type":"prop","who":"barmen","item":"coin","action":"put"},{"type":"line","ref":"l18"},{"type":"move","who":"barmen","to":"counter"},{"type":"act","who":"barmen","act":"laugh"},{"type":"line","ref":"l19"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"glass","action":"hold"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"drink"},{"type":"line","ref":"l20"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"coin","action":"hold"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"coin","action":"put"},{"type":"line","ref":"l21"},{"type":"line","ref":"l22"}]}]}
{"id":"ru-e83b816c03db.de","jokeId":"ru-e83b816c03db","locale":"de","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Translated line by line, every narration step kept; dollars localised to euros (one-euro and two-euro coins make the trick even more natural). Same staging: three bar scenes with wipes, barman behind the counter, counter ends on the back plane left and right.","title":"Das Wechselgeld","location":"bar","cast":["barmen","muzhik"],"roles":{"barmen":"bartender","muzhik":"customer"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Ein Mann kommt in eine Bar und bestellt einen Whisky:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Was bin ich schuldig?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"barmen","text":"Drei Euro.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Der Mann holt drei Euro aus der Tasche.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Einen legt er vor sich auf die Theke,","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"dann geht er ans linke Ende der Theke und legt dort den zweiten hin,","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"dann geht er ans rechte Ende der Theke und legt dort den dritten hin.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Der Barkeeper geht leise fluchend nach rechts und nach links und sammelt das Geld ein.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Am nächsten Tag kommt derselbe Mann wieder,","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"bestellt wieder ein Gläschen Whisky und verteilt die Euros wieder an die verschiedenen Enden der Theke.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Der Barkeeper ärgert sich, aber er holt sich das Geld.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Kurz gesagt, das wiederholt sich Tag für Tag.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Und eines Tages bestellt der Mann einen Whisky, nimmt das Glas,","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"kramt in der Tasche und zieht einen Fünf-Euro-Schein heraus.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Der Barkeeper schnappt sich schnell den Schein, lächelt rachsüchtig,","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"holt zwei Euro Wechselgeld heraus,","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"geht ans linke Ende der Theke und legt dort einen Euro hin,","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"dann geht er ans rechte Ende und legt dort den zweiten hin.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Dann kommt er zurück und schaut den Mann schadenfroh an.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Der Mann trinkt seelenruhig seinen Whisky aus,","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"holt einen Euro aus der Tasche, legt ihn vor sich hin und sagt:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Ich glaube, ich nehme noch ein Gläschen.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"bar","cast":["barmen","muzhik"],"roles":{"barmen":"bartender","muzhik":"customer"},"looks":{"muzhik":{"add":["flat-cap"],"remove":[]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"barmen","to":"counter"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","from":"off-left","to":"center"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"money","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"money","action":"put"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"left","plane":"back"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"money","action":"hold"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"money","action":"put"},{"type"